  "label": "scene of emaciated victims in extreme suffering",
  "description": "The scene depicts multiple emaciated human bodies in a state of extreme suffering and death, likely Holocaust victims. One body is suspended upside down by its feet from a wooden structure, with its head and upper torso visible. Another body lies partially covered by a blanket, with its face visible and showing extreme emaciation. Additional bodies are visible in the background, lying on the ground. The bodies are arranged in a grim, chaotic composition, conveying a sense of horror and despair. The spatial arrangement suggests a location of mass suffering, possibly a camp or execution site. The scene is dominated by the visual elements of starvation, trauma, and death.",
